{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_title", "source_sha256": "c0ac368607df8b5b2cdc8a268d6c6190668153454a4a967d6ad9d1fec832b511", "ja": "舞台袖にて　～追い風特盛りフルコース～", "zh": "舞台侧边　～顺风特大份全餐～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0e3c47a2123b68448a925868fcf65801e1aeaba71e02e3e54975a2ba45a1a4e4", "ja": "ライブも終盤に向かう中、大盛況ぶりを喜ぶ\nアイドル達。貴音は油断しないよう忠告をす\nるが、美奈子と歩は、もっと盛り上げると気\n合いも十分な様子。頼もしい後輩達の姿に\n貴音は安心するのだった。", "zh": "演唱会也即将进入尾声。公演盛况空前，\n令偶像们非常高兴。贵音提出忠告要大家\n别松懈，不过美奈子和步干劲十足，\n表示要更加炒热气氛。\n看到后辈们可靠的模样，贵音感到安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7add51792e0fd3acc9d9a675f828ac2e2d7a5854b23fc2ac1e38b7f89f63a459", "ja": "今日のみんな、張り切ってるな～！\nダンスもキレキレで、めちゃくちゃカッコイイよ！", "zh": "大家今天好有干劲呢～！\n舞蹈动作都很到位，超级帅气的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "c9c4e2bdc5df375a125cabf98619c9e433054632e7800a7e7198c9ed63141a29", "ja": "ええ。お客さんも盛り上がってるし……\n今のところ、公演は大成功と言っていいわね。", "zh": "是啊，观众也很热情……\n就目前而言，可以说公演相当成功呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "f28307c71899747be35103b80d8c5d9bf92e3f82f830c821801e211c25639925", "ja": "ですが、舞台とは絶えず変化する場所。\n気を抜けば、追い風も逆風となりましょう。", "zh": "不过，舞台是一个瞬息万变的地方。\n要是松懈了，顺风也可能会变成逆风。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "b0708839f4b69e9c6272ad2c9d49ff2e85c2f670884c943ee58ce9a7aa987c38", "ja": "貴音ちゃん、大丈夫だよ。これから私たちみんなで\n目いっぱい、盛り上がりを追加しちゃうんだから！", "zh": "贵音，没问题的，因为我们大家\n接下来会尽全力让气氛变得更热烈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2214505433e8af9433bd6ef633df4f15bf0cffb4ef9b0e24d7cb776b22bc2aba", "ja": "イエス！　アタシもダンス、バッチリ決めて\n思いっきり盛り上げてみせるよっ！", "zh": "Yes！我也会跳出最精彩的舞蹈，\n彻底炒热气氛的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "864912caec3967ab6381d94a50e2e9b6895fd2c0afe3d66b322bb7ed14ffa8e3", "ja": "二人のその心意気……真、頼もしいことです。\nどうやら、無用な心配だったようですね。ふふっ。", "zh": "你们两位的决心……着实可靠。\n看来是小女子杞人忧天了，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "81fc6381e2735dfcfeb009d8372282071c481708f07f925f2a41617829e74c1e", "ja": "（ワアアアア……！）", "zh": "（哗啊啊啊啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "1388bb01bfe3930a8049ef525894025094db6fd7607354007c1e8ea5b1206781", "ja": "前のステージが終わったみたいね。\nみんな、準備はいい？", "zh": "前一段表演好像结束了呢。\n大家准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "152dc1dab9a76fc534d3051a7b2fc1c6aa6ec55474b35b29043631d0b9e682e8", "ja": "あ、ちょっと待って！　え～と、水分水分……。\nちょっと喉が乾いちゃってさ、へへっ。", "zh": "啊，等一下！呃～水分水分……\n我口有点渴了，嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "37a2145192739512458bbdafd0e8a666b64e37dc1c220705674e057b2e4368fd", "ja": "歩ちゃん、お水の他にスポーツドリンクも\n置いておいたから、好きなの選んでね♪", "zh": "小步，除了水之外，我还放了运动饮料，\n选你喜欢的喝喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "cd8b03120069bfa54f0b921a95a7e495d110921a1997b2f8f17908bec78c9a75", "ja": "あ、それともお腹すいたかな？\nラーメンぐらいなら、すぐに作れるけど？", "zh": "啊，还是说你肚子饿了？\n拉面的话，我是可以马上做一碗出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "24f161c7004d333e25bab45403066ff8405401a979fb4ef0a5bd3d3dcc676de5", "ja": "（はっ……！）", "zh": "（啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "f9f6cba7235e018f0ddf7fc2c16801b01ea02bd72801bf0388430a00cb2d690a", "ja": "作らなくていいの！\n……って、貴音も心を動かされない！", "zh": "不用做啦！\n呃……贵音也不要被诱惑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "3a03b18b62435498226742be79375f1760b5ebccee8b269cb7514f94dfc0f850", "ja": "安心してください。私の心は舞台に向けられたまま。\n打ち上げのことなど考えてもいません。", "zh": "请放心，小女子的心一直向着舞台，\n并没有在思考庆功宴之类的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "ef7370cdad9e97153ce242553dd40a6e0f59e05865b54431ce804bfba36bde2d", "ja": "誰も打ち上げの話はしてないけど……まったくもう。", "zh": "没有人在讲庆功宴好吗……真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "421513c1be52165eacaedb98b6b52bde6f7450955b45b77fb376a81f7f8620df", "ja": "よし、オッケー、お待たせ～！\nみんなもオッケーだよな？", "zh": "好，OK～让你们久等了！\n大家也都OK了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "0166d63b9a8e1195e28cb83924db8dfc9ecf7ae3c0a5c22af55d47323452d833", "ja": "もちろん！　特盛りのステージで、\nファンのみんなを大満足させちゃおうね！", "zh": "那当然！就让我们用特大份的表演，\n大大满足各位粉丝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_11_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "f9fd6b72b50bcd876c27333dc9f7cc9067f1e46a67c67f4befdb016b9fa6b6aa", "ja": "それじゃ、全員準備ができたってことで……\n行くわよ！　みんなの待つステージに！", "zh": "那么，既然所有人都准备好了……\n那我们走啰！前往大家等待的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
